      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "The body politic of the Skath is referred to as 'The Council of Elders' and is exactly what it sounds like. The four eldest of their kind rule the entire species. It is the only such form of government known in the cosmos (for how can only four dictate the course of an entire species?) but has maintained power over the Skath Imperium for at least two to three hundred years."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "スカースの国は「長老会議」と呼ばれ、まさにそのように聞こえます。 この種の四つの最長は、種全体を支配します。 宇宙で知られる限り、この形の政府は他にない。たった四人が、どうやって種族全体の進む道を決められるというのか？ それでも、スカス帝国では少なくとも二百年から三百年、この体制が権力を維持してきた。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "To be considered for the council, a Skath must first reach the age of Last Nest (somewhere around sixty in human years) and have no less than three hundred offspring. His role in the military must have been a major one, with a rank no less than Admiral. Finally, they must have seen combat at least twice (heroics and long-standing combat records are preferred.)"
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "評議会のために考慮されるためには、スカスはまずラストネスト(人間の年の約六〇歳)の年齢に達し、少なくとも三〇〇人の子孫を持つ必要があります。 軍における彼の役割は、海軍提督に劣らず階級のある主要なものだったにちがいない。 最後に、少なくとも二度の実戦経験が必要だ（英雄的な活躍や、長年にわたる戦歴があればなお望ましい）。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/2",
      "value": "The first council is said to have been voted upon by the people, but all documentation of that era has been long since lost. Personally, I find it hard to believe that an entire species agreed that absolute power over all should rest on the shoulders of their Elders. The logistics of that are frightening, to say the least. The reality is worse."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/2",
      "value": "最初の評議会は国民によって投票されたと言われていますが、その時代の文書はすべて、長い間失われてきました。 個人的には、種全体が、すべてのものに対する絶対的な力は、彼らの長老の肩に委ねるべきであると同意したと信じることは難しいと思います。 控えめに言っても、その物流は恐ろしいものです。 現実はもっと悪い。"
    }
